  "content": "# 第33题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★★☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\nWhat can we learn from this passage?\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. ALife holds the key to human future.\n\nB. B. ALife and AI share a common feature.\n\nC. C. AI mirrors the developments of ALife.\n\nD. D. AI speeds up the process of human evolution.\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nB\n\n",
  "answer": "B",
  "analysis": "本题考查介词短语。A. 代替；B. 尽管；C. 因为；D. 除了。句意‘尽管下雨，他们还是继续工作’，故选B。"
